OPNfluent is a modern, responsive theme for the OPNsense administration UI.
It combines a Fluent-inspired visual language with layered Mica-like surfaces,
clear focus states, accessible contrast and automatic light/dark preferences.

The package also provides the integrated Theme & Branding administration page
for colors, title, logo and favicon configuration including image uploads.

The theme is based on the current OPNsense administration theme structure.
